  "h3_basis": [
    "ADR 0009 requires the earliest defensible Provider Availability Time for the exact revision; a prospective REST receipt cannot prove that this earliest time exactly equals fundingTime.",
    "MarketEvent requires available_time at or after event_time and G10E fixes publication and settlement at fundingTime; later receipt fails equality, while at-or-before observation still does not prove exact first availability.",
    "Funding Rate History exposes no revision/as-of selector or complete correction history; polling cannot prove a complete settlement-visible revision lineage or exclude revisions between samples."
  ],
